==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Othom]] spawns as the boss after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*6 [[Brollow]]s spawn after 216.67 seconds<sup>6,500f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since every enemy spawns on a relatively long timer, you can just kill the Pigeon de Sables with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] for money, then spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to kill the base before any threats can spawn for a free win.

A high-level [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] with the [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]] [[Talents|Talent]] makes this stage much easier, for it can not only avoid the Relic Doge Base's curse and thus tank an absurd amount of hits from all of the enemies, but is also able to block the [[Wave Attack|Waves]] from Pigeon de Sable and Bun Bun Symbiote.

Snipers such as [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Mina]] or [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Naala]] can be used to chip at the Othom by using [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necro-Dancer Cat]] to perma-freeze the Bun Bun. [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]] proves useful here, being able to one-shot the Brollows and Pigeons while having Curse-Immune to be unaffected by Othom's curse. Lure Bun Bun to the base so your attackers and CC units will not be affected by the Curse Base.

This stage can also be rushed using a Sm. attack combo and [[Rich Cat III (Super Rare Cat)|Richest Cat]]'s two combos. Simply save a little at the start, kill Pigeon de Sable with [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], and then it's as simple as sending out [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and spamming more rushers.

On higher Star difficulties, Othom can be rushed once the Bun Bun is knockedback with a combination of units such as Naala, [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Doron]], [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi]], and units such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] or [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]].

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Theatre of Fear]] stages, Normal Activity is named after a horror movie, in this case ''[[wikipedia:Paranormal Activity|Paranormal Activity]]''.
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], the stage width was set to 4,800. The change was made because of a bug in how [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Bases]] spawn when not set as bosses.

